	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Alfred front-end for the beeper-search CLI (Beeper Desktop local API); it must be on your login shell's PATH, or set the BEEPER_SEARCH_BIN workflow variable.

Keyword: bs (or beeper)

Return     → open the chat in Beeper at that message
Cmd+Enter  → copy the message text
Opt+Enter  → open the message's first link

Words match anywhere in a chat, in any order (stems and compounds too); one row per chat, ranked by how many words matched, then recency. Opens on the current Space when Beeper is assigned to All Desktops (Hammerspoon hides it again on Space switch).</string>
